alwaysApply: true
---

# Database rules

- One migration per bounded context per PR. Never bundle.
- Every table has `id`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt` unless immutable (events).
- Events (`VerificationEvent`, `AdminAction`, `StripeWebhookEvent`) are
  append-only. No updates, no deletes.
- Enum values are SCREAMING_SNAKE.
- Foreign keys always have an index.
- Never edit a migration that's already been applied to staging or production.
- After schema changes run `pnpm prisma migrate dev` and commit the migration.
